## 1. What did you do? (input, logic, output)

### 🗣️ Respuesta corta

> "I extended the existing Group Comparator tab in the Firewall section. **Input**: a group name and a reference FW tag. **Logic**: load the group tree for every firewall from the DB, compare each one against the reference group by group with set differences, and build the alignment commands. **Output**: a summary table (one row per firewall, with status and added/missing counts), an expandable detail per subgroup, a copy button for the alignment commands, and a CSV export."

